stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unsent : Bundle.finalise stamps seq

    Unsent --> InFlight : Nub.send writes packet\nbit set in 32-bit outstanding-ack bitmap\nresend timer = 700ms

    InFlight --> AwaitingAck : 700ms timer elapses\nUnAckedHandler scans bitmap

    AwaitingAck --> InFlight : retransmit_count < 20\nresend same seq\nretransmit_count++

    AwaitingAck --> Disconnected : retransmit_count > 20\nChannel transitions Disconnected\n(strict-greater check)

    InFlight --> Acked : peer's ack list contains seq\nprocessAck clears bit in bitmap

    Acked --> [*]

    Disconnected --> [*]

    note right of InFlight
        seq_id occupies bit (seq_id & 0x1F)
        in ChannelInternal's 32-bit
        outstanding-ack bitmap
        (UnAckedHandler at +0x?? offset).
    end note

    note left of AwaitingAck
        700ms ACK timeout inherited
        from stock BigWorld 2.0.1.
        SGW divergence not enumerated
        in V5 evidence.
    end note
